    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b70656ec6bf9413a844d",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 69,
      "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3ac7e9940998facf191e",
      "document_start": 70,
      "document_end": 102,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2b0d1263d802892b4447",
      "document_start": 104,
      "document_end": 170,
      "text": "另外，某些材料在常应力条件下，其变形与时间有关，往往随着载荷作用时间的延长，其蠕变应变增大，这种蠕变的非线性主要由材料物理性态引起。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2ef1acb9089816f07c9d",
      "document_start": 170,
      "document_end": 206,
      "text": "材料的应变随时间变化的特性称为黏性，可分为线性黏性材料和非线性黏性材料。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2c9da22002da968b6ed0",
      "document_start": 206,
      "document_end": 253,
      "text": "具有黏性的材料可以采用一些简单的力学模型，如黏性元件、弹性元件、塑性元件等，如图2-18所示。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_94ab10ab5441c5d184fe",
      "document_start": 255,
      "document_end": 275,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7f557e28cf3427ef94ca",
      "document_start": 276,
      "document_end": 286,
      "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1f3be8f3d4fe23dcb121",
      "document_start": 287,
      "document_end": 319,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b0de3b201dc13e4d0469",
      "document_start": 321,
      "document_end": 344,
      "text": "将弹性元件与黏性元件组合，可得黏弹性材料模型。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1207937aa1c80f9a1036",
      "document_start": 344,
      "document_end": 368,
      "text": "将其并联，称为开尔文（Kelvin）黏弹性模型；",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f5c5bd814241ae77b5ed",
      "document_start": 368,
      "document_end": 395,
      "text": "将其串联，称为麦克斯韦尔（Maxwell）黏弹性模型。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_bedd48a936a78e749bc3",
      "document_start": 395,
      "document_end": 462,
      "text": "将弹性、塑性和黏性三类元件以不同的形式加以组合，可以获得更为复杂的材料模型，如广义开尔文模型、Burgers模型等，如图2-19所示。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7ef2e460c0b235851da9",
      "document_start": 464,
      "document_end": 484,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7ff691ab739a5035fcfd",
      "document_start": 485,
      "document_end": 495,
      "text": "# 2）几何非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_53de36b6b5bc741e40bc",
      "document_start": 496,
      "document_end": 528,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_acffd22001167dadff7d",
      "document_start": 530,
      "document_end": 586,
      "text": "另一类几何非线性问题是指有限变形（或大应变）问题，如一些非金属材料即使在弹性状态下，也可能产生很大的变形和位移。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ccb6de06113fa31c9955",
      "document_start": 586,
      "document_end": 676,
      "text": "其变形过程已经不可能直接用初始状态（未受力的状态）加以描述，平衡状态的几何位置未知，其应力、应变定义和度量准则也与线性问题不同，因此给几何大变形非线性问题的方程建立和求解带来困难。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d6559dc58b3b00132a89",
      "document_start": 676,
      "document_end": 737,
      "text": "此外，还有小应变、小转动，但是应变与转动相比为高阶小量的几何非线性问题，结构稳定性分析中的许多初始屈曲问题都属于这种情况。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_bf4900b7cd420af4ff02",
      "document_start": 739,
      "document_end": 759,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1b86f1ddc5f95cad525f",
      "document_start": 760,
      "document_end": 770,
      "text": "# 3）边界非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_dd27a5011c26ab76bb65",
      "document_start": 771,
      "document_end": 803,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_71c910d8c851af9f5159",
      "document_start": 805,
      "document_end": 879,
      "text": "边界非线性包括两个结构物的接触边界随加载和变形而改变引起的接触非线性（包含有摩擦接触和无摩擦接触）、非线性弹性地基的非线性边界条件和可动边界问题等。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1cc588059c41878580ab",
      "document_start": 881,
      "document_end": 901,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d7783fbbe0c5ecd7ecc3",
      "document_start": 902,
      "document_end": 912,
      "text": "# 3）边界非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8e89545773d50b37d07d",
      "document_start": 913,
      "document_end": 945,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2f9584a6a5e1be7d7521",
      "document_start": 947,
      "document_end": 992,
      "text": "两个物体相互接触后，随着两个物体间接触合力的变化，其接触面大小和接触处的应力均会发生变化。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1fe04833af7ce02f652e",
      "document_start": 992,
      "document_end": 1024,
      "text": "这些变化不仅与接触合力的大小有关，而且与两个物体的材料性质有关。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_445624186fab976864d7",
      "document_start": 1024,
      "document_end": 1053,
      "text": "即使材料性质是线性弹性的，接触问题仍然表现出强非线性性质。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_87b17780046ad4635524",
      "document_start": 1053,
      "document_end": 1082,
      "text": "如果材料性质是非线性的，接触非线性性质表现更为强烈与复杂。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a5d2019b5e2fcd4b6a8f",
      "document_start": 1082,
      "document_end": 1107,
      "text": "碰撞问题是一类与边界质点速度有关的边界非线性问题。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_efcddefcfcb85d07cfef",
      "document_start": 1107,
      "document_end": 1135,
      "text": "边界非线性中有相当一部分问题不再遵循最小势能原理，而呈现",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_11b15cbe099697cb2f98",
      "document_start": 1137,
      "document_end": 1157,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d72909f8709e8e32fddb",
      "document_start": 1158,
      "document_end": 1170,
      "text": "# 2）显式中心差分法;",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5d2df742bcbfaa3c636b",
      "document_start": 1171,
      "document_end": 1203,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e9bd3120bf208fd942e4",
      "document_start": 1205,
      "document_end": 1263,
      "text": "针对2阶常微分方程组的动力学方程，可用前差格式、后差格式和中心差分格式等不同的有限差分格式来建立逐步积分的递推格式。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ffac9e87f643fb222b76",
      "document_start": 1263,
      "document_end": 1298,
      "text": "其中，中心差分法是显式算法中最有代表性、应用最广泛、最有效的算法之一。",
      "section_id": "section_6b6b95fac1a1"
    }
  ],
